  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the No Lost Generation Initiative through UNICEF activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the No Lost Generation Initiative through UNICEF activities is a component of Lebanon No Lost Generation Initiative (NLGI) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;105,999,999. It works in the following sector(s): Primary education, Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322), Social Protection, Education policy and administrative management, Facilitation of orderly, safe, regular and responsible migration and mobility, Early childhood education, Ending violence against women and girls, Basic life skills for adults.</narrative>
  </description>
